{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3171", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3171/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3171/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3171/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/3171", "id": 3601054061, "node_id": "I_kwDOLW-eZs7Wo7lt", "number": 3171, "title": "[combobox] Controlled Combobox with primitive-typed items menu issues", "user": {"login": "hsimpson270", "id": 34924402, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTI0NDAy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34924402?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270", "html_url": "https://github.com/hsimpson270", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 6621343728, "node_id": "LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABiqmv8A", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20expected%20behavior", "name": "type: expected behavior", "color": "fef2c0", "default": false, "description": "The current behavior is already the one expected.", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 9169581687, "node_id": "LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAACIoy2dw", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20combobox", "name": "component: combobox", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "Changes related to the combobox component.", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 4, "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:23:14Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-08T04:34:18Z", "closed_at": "2025-11-08T04:34:18Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "# Bug report\n\n## Current behavior\n\nWhen using a controlled `Combobox`, supplying `items` with a primitive-typed list (such as `number[]`) results in inconsistent menu item displays. The first render works as expected, but after selecting an item, the next list shown when opening the combobox won't display all of the values. After selecting an item here and then reopening the list, all items are shown once again. This behavior alternates each time the menu is opened.\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n1. Supply `Combobox.Root` with an `items` list of type `number[]`.\n2. Supply `Combobox.Root` with `value` and `onValueChange` from `useState`\n3. Open the combobox and select an item\n4. Open the combobox again and notice some list items are missing\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nAll list items should appear on every click for primitive-typed lists supplied to a controlled combobox.\n\n## Reproducible example\n\n[CodeSandbox](https://codesandbox.io/p/devbox/competent-dubinsky-yypmy7?workspaceId=ws_ETNffou6NaBLZZa3osW8s6)\n\n## Base\u00a0UI version\n\nv1.0.0-beta.4\n\n## Which browser are you using?\n\nChrome\n\n## Which OS are you using?\n\nWindows\n\n## Which assistive tech are you using (if applicable)?\n\nN/A\n\n## Additional context\n\nN/A\n", "closed_by": {"login": "hsimpson270", "id": 34924402, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTI0NDAy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34924402?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270", "html_url": "https://github.com/hsimpson270", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3171/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3171/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3505628805", "html_url": "https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/3171#issuecomment-3505628805", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3171", "id": 3505628805, "node_id": "IC_kwDOLW-eZs7Q86aF", "user": {"login": "atomiks", "id": 22450188, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks", "html_url": "https://github.com/atomiks", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:28:07Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-08T02:28:07Z", "body": "With Combobox, you must use `<Combobox.Input>` for the behavior to work as expected. If you want an input-less Combobox, you need to use a Select (which includes the a11y features part of the select pattern)", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3505628805/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3505644545", "html_url": "https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/3171#issuecomment-3505644545", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3171", "id": 3505644545, "node_id": "IC_kwDOLW-eZs7Q8-QB", "user": {"login": "hsimpson270", "id": 34924402, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTI0NDAy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34924402?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270", "html_url": "https://github.com/hsimpson270", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:37:12Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-08T02:37:12Z", "body": "Thanks for the additional info. For context, this is for a component library where Combobox is the basis for our Dropdown component. We do include a `Combobox.Input` component inside the `Combobox.Popup` like what is shown in the [Input inside popup](https://base-ui.com/react/components/combobox#input-inside-popup) example, but that Input is conditional since we don't always want to show search functionality.\n\nI was attempting to just use Combobox for one universal dropdown component, but if `Combobox.Input` is always required would you recommend creating two separate controls?\n\nFor additional context, the same example I linked does work if `items` is an object array instead of a primitive typed array, even without `Combobox.Input`, it's only the primitive lists that cause this issue.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3505644545/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3505696224", "html_url": "https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/3171#issuecomment-3505696224", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3171", "id": 3505696224, "node_id": "IC_kwDOLW-eZs7Q9K3g", "user": {"login": "atomiks", "id": 22450188, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks", "html_url": "https://github.com/atomiks", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-11-08T03:08:03Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-08T03:08:03Z", "body": "> I was attempting to just use Combobox for one universal dropdown component, but if Combobox.Input is always required would you recommend creating two separate controls?\n\nAs it stands yes, there are UX and a11y features that Combobox lacks when it doesn't have an input. A Combobox that doesn't have an input is just a Select, and we have a component dedicated to that. I would recommend splitting them into two like we have\n\n> For additional context, the same example I linked does work if items is an object array instead of a primitive typed array, even without Combobox.Input, it's only the primitive lists that cause this issue.\n\nIIRC there was another issue reported when omitting `Input`, can't find the issue but there's an internal state used that gets set by the Input component which is why it breaks when it doesn't exist", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3505696224/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3505897433", "html_url": "https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/3171#issuecomment-3505897433", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3171", "id": 3505897433, "node_id": "IC_kwDOLW-eZs7Q97_Z", "user": {"login": "hsimpson270", "id": 34924402, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTI0NDAy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34924402?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270", "html_url": "https://github.com/hsimpson270", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:34:18Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-08T04:34:18Z", "body": "Thank you for the response. I will look into splitting it into two components and be sure the `Input` is always included when `Combobox` is used. It may be worth adding some mention of that to the docs just to avoid this coming up later. Thanks again.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3505897433/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]}